Every Information Commissioner shall hold office
for a term of 5 years or until the age of 65 years,
whichever is earlier.

questions.explanation:
There are three types of Emergencies envisaged under the
Indian Constitution-
(1) 	National Emergency under the Article 352;
(2)	 State emergency declared on failure of Constitutional
machinery in a State under Article 356;
(3)	 Financial emergency under Article 360.
